# Excluded from the public asset upload.
#
# The Cloudflare assets directory for this project is the deploy root
# ("assets": {"directory": "."}), so any file present at deploy time is
# otherwise served at https://hodacfo.com/<path>. That is exactly how
# /.git/HEAD, /.git/config, /.git/index and /wrangler.jsonc reached the
# public wire. Same format as .gitignore.
#
# Do NOT add _headers or _redirects here: the platform consumes those
# (both already return 404 on the wire) and ignoring them would drop the
# security headers and every UTM short link.

.git/
.gitignore
.wrangler/
wrangler.jsonc
